Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1
    Language: en

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    AbstractionLevel: High
    Caption: Count hits of one word in a short text

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: count_hits
        Params: words, needle
        Returns: c

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Scan position starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Hits start at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: c

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: List length bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: words
            Returns: n

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while position is inside
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, n
            Returns: cont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Linear scan with an explicit bound
            Condition: cont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current word
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: words, i
                    Returns: w

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Compare with the needle
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: w, needle
                    Returns: hit

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Count the hit or keep the tally
                    Condition: hit

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: One more hit
                            Op: Core.Add
                            Params: c, 1
                            Returns: c

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Tally unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: c
                            Returns: c

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the position
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, n
                    Returns: cont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Hit count
            State: Ok
            Returns: c

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: main
        Returns: c1

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Text under test
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: "the cat sat on the mat"
            Returns: text

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Split on spaces
            Op: Core.StrSplit
            Params: text, " "
            Returns: words

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Count the article in an isolated call frame
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: count_hits, words, "the"
            Returns: c1

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Hits of the needle
            State: Ok
            Returns: c1
